[
  {
    "text": "Worst advice introverts get:",
    "sub": "“just put yourself out there.”",
    "seconds": 4,
    "big": true
  },
  {
    "text": "Out *where*? For how long?\nDoing what?",
    "seconds": 3.5
  },
  {
    "text": "Pressure isn't a plan.",
    "seconds": 2.5
  },
  {
    "text": "What works is *structure*:",
    "sub": "an event with a start and an end.\nOne micro-goal. An exit rule.",
    "seconds": 5.5
  },
  {
    "text": "“Stay 45 minutes.\nAsk one person one question.\nThen you're free.”",
    "seconds": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "Repeatable beats brave.",
    "seconds": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "Try the *Solo Night Generator*.",
    "sub": "Link in bio.",
    "seconds": 3
  }
]
